  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1692721062_2583610_a8bca8d03f8ff5323d11f9c815e3d5c9Lyonsleaf_Logo_Type_Left_PMS_4975-noCan (3).png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h1 style=\"margin-right: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Welcome to <span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Lyonsleaf - the Republic of Natural Skincare.&nbsp;</span></span></h1><p style=\"margin-right: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Specialising in natural, sustainable and cruelty free skincare that’s gentle to your skin and suitable for the whole family. Our 100% natural and award-winning blends include beneficial home-grown herbs that are infused with plant oils. A winning combination for super sensitive skin.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Our products contain:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 14, 14); font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Naturally nourishing plant oils -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Organic beeswax - Minerals - Home-grown herbal extracts<strong>&nbsp;…and absolutely nothing else.</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Oil is the key to Lyonsleaf’s power; unlike water-based products (that can, in the long run, dry out your skin) our undiluted, completely natural, oil-based formulas offer far superior hydration and protection, especially for difficult or delicate skin.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\" href=\"https://www.Lyonsleaf.co.uk\">www.lyonsleaf.co.uk</a></span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Why join us at Lyonsleaf?</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">We're a quirky team of epic women based in Somerset who really believe in what we do. Our customer reviews are nothing less than exceptional and consequently have amassed a stream of repeat and loyal customers. We are immensely proud to produce excellent quality, award winning products at an affordable price that are not only suitable for everyday use but have also had such an impact for a range of skin types. From super sensitive baby skin to eco friendly alternatives Lyonsleaf products appeal to a broad audience. Lyonsleaf's products gained huge traction with problem skin users due to our water free recipes. Our super gentle but epically potent ingredients are safe, effective and completely free of any artifcial ingredients ensuring your skin reaps all the benefits.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">As an affiliate you can join our existing team of Rebel-lyons and enjoy multiple perks in our very generous affiliate program. Including:&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">20% Commission on all sales&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">20% Discount code for followers</span></li><li style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">30% Personal use discount</span></li><li style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Flexibility to create your own promotions</span></li><li style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Access to our extensive media gallery&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">On-hand support and encouragement</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Commission is paid out monthly via Paypal.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Come and give the products a go and we hope to see you on the other side!&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\"><br>Join the republic of natural skincare today and revolutionise your skincare.&nbsp;</span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 14, 14);\">Lyonsleaf in the media:</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/femail/article-9448767/Babys-eczema-disappeared-hours-using-10-95-cream.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.dailymail.co.uk/femail/article-9448767/Babys-eczema-disappeared-hours-using-10-95-cream.html</a></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/femail/article-10766373/Mother-reveals-developed-open-sores-oozing-skin-went-steroid-withdrawal.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.dailymail.co.uk/femail/article-10766373/Mother-reveals-developed-open-sores-oozing-skin-went-steroid-withdrawal.html</a></p><p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.thesun.co.uk/news/12769039/woman-plagued-skin-condition-cure-10-95-miracle-cream/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.thesun.co.uk/news/12769039/woman-plagued-skin-condition-cure-10-95-miracle-cream/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>",
